<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 219 0 R
/E (The digital marketing space will try to make you feel behind. It will show you people further along the road and imply that you should already be where they are. You are not behind. You are exactly where a person building something real is supposed to be. Fifteen days in. A creator identity established. A content practice begun. A canvas full of data to build from. That is not the beginning of a failure story. That is the beginning.)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
604 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 219 0 R
/E (Before you design anything, analyse what the canvas revealed. Ask yourself: What content felt most natural and most consistent? What formats did I gravitate toward? What did my audience respond to, even in small numbers? What do I want to say, and who do I want to say it to? Write the answers down. They are the inputs for everything that comes next.)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
